{"3628400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Ship", "steam_appid": 3628400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/d3ab103e3509609dbe91a605a0a88754.avif?t=1781687066\" width=800 height=545 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>“I chose this nightmare, cold and clear.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>I’d be dead already if I hadn’t let myself get eaten alive.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/92b6522125ae3b004dccb2d2ee7f6ed6.poster.avif?t=1781687066\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/92b6522125ae3b004dccb2d2ee7f6ed6.webm?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/92b6522125ae3b004dccb2d2ee7f6ed6.mp4?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Ship is a story‑driven survival horror with a cinematic edge. Single‑player. Full voice acting. Controller ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You board a cursed warship where Zombies and Undead Machines rival each other but unite against you. Play as Harry. Fate left him no choice. To survive, he must pass through death, the only salvation left to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the ship, watch patrols, read the food chain. Pick your approach: slip past in the dark, bait a split, or hit hard and fast. Engage only when it’s worth the bullets. Scavenge keys, tools, meds, ammo. Crack new routes and shortcuts. Hazards bite, traps lurk in every dark corner, and Undead Machines close in. Outlast the dead. Dethrone the Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/c34d99663ae1f0a136cd560964a735cb.poster.avif?t=1781687066\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/c34d99663ae1f0a136cd560964a735cb.webm?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/c34d99663ae1f0a136cd560964a735cb.mp4?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival, Single Player, Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic Storytelling, Lore-Rich Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and Scavenging of the Rotting Warship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Hierarchies: Boss, Thinking Zombies, Undead Machines, Savage Zombies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat, Stealth, and Resource Management with Limited Supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Events, Environmental Hazards, Deadly Traps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/10ceceeea286fcd6befaff1fcd5f7fdf.poster.avif?t=1781687066\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/10ceceeea286fcd6befaff1fcd5f7fdf.webm?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/10ceceeea286fcd6befaff1fcd5f7fdf.mp4?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORYLINE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harry isn’t the type to simply survive. He craves the power to bend immortality to his will. His days are numbered. Unless he cheats death. And he’s damn well trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tHe steps onto a cursed warship crawling with zombies and machines. A fractured hierarchy teeters on the edge of rebellion. The Boss holds the throne, but everyone wants a piece. Undead Machines scheme to rise. Thinking Zombies plot to dominate humans. The weak die. Survival is the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tEvery decision Harry makes shapes the unfolding power struggle. He fights not just to survive, but to assert his will. The battle for the Boss’s throne ignites, and every choice could cost him everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/d5c4e13ad26b810cbf42c7e7297a9075.poster.avif?t=1781687066\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/d5c4e13ad26b810cbf42c7e7297a9075.webm?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/d5c4e13ad26b810cbf42c7e7297a9075.mp4?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ZOMBIE SHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zombie Ship</i> blends raw survival tension with a story-driven narrative, demanding strategic choices in an immersive, high-stakes horror experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Zombie Ship calls. Will you survive the nightmare and claim the throne? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <i>Zombie Ship</i> to your wishlist now, and prepare for a horror journey like no other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/b8e206380742d001963b84dfb434d19e.poster.avif?t=1781687066\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/b8e206380742d001963b84dfb434d19e.webm?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/b8e206380742d001963b84dfb434d19e.mp4?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/d3ab103e3509609dbe91a605a0a88754.avif?t=1781687066\" width=800 height=545 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>“I chose this nightmare, cold and clear.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>I’d be dead already if I hadn’t let myself get eaten alive.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/92b6522125ae3b004dccb2d2ee7f6ed6.poster.avif?t=1781687066\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/92b6522125ae3b004dccb2d2ee7f6ed6.webm?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co