agraph\" >Enemy Hierarchies: Boss, Thinking Zombies, Undead Machines, Savage Zombies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat, Stealth, and Resource Management with Limited Supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Events, Environmental Hazards, Deadly Traps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/10ceceeea286fcd6befaff1fcd5f7fdf.poster.avif?t=1781687066\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/10ceceeea286fcd6befaff1fcd5f7fdf.webm?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/10ceceeea286fcd6befaff1fcd5f7fdf.mp4?t=1781687066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORYLINE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harry isn’t the type to simply survive. He craves the power to bend immortality to his will. His days are numbered. Unless he cheats death. And he’s damn well trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tHe steps onto a cursed warship crawling with zombies and machines. A fractured hierarchy teeters on the edge of rebellion. The Boss holds the throne, but everyone wants a piece. Undead Machines scheme to rise. Thinking Zombies plot to dominate humans. The weak die. Survival is the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tEvery decision Harry makes shapes the unfolding power struggle. He fights not just to survive, but to assert his will. The battle for the Boss’s throne ignites, and every choice could cost him everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/d5c4e13ad26b810cbf42c7e7297a9075.